                  "text": "Jos 3:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Eliya wakabweza cikobela cakwe, wacivunga, wacuumya maanzi, nkabela mpawo maanzi akaandaanisigwa kumwi akumwi, aboobo bakazubuka boonse bobile mutala cakweenda ansi.",
          "type": "text",
