              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joh 14:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo wakabweza cikobela ca-Eliya cakamuloka, wacuumya maanzi, wati, Uli kuli-Jehova Leza wa-Eliya? Nkabela naakamana kuuma maanzi, maanzi akaandaanisigwa kumwi akumwi, aboobo Elisha wakazubuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
