        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bana babusinsimi ibakakede ku-Jeriko, nibakamubona ulilangene abo, bakati, Muuya wa-Eliya wakala ali-Elisha. Elyo bakeza kuzoomuswananya, bamukotamina ansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.15",
