                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela bakamwaambila kuti, Bona! Okuno kulindiswe tubalanda bako kuli baalumi basinguzu bali makumi osanwe. Bainke kuyooyandaula simalelaako. Ambweni Muuya wa-Jehova wakamutola, wamutula amwi atala acilundu nanka mumwi mumumpata. Pele wakati, Mutatumi pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekubaboobo nibakacili kumusungilizya, wakafwa insoni, wati, Mbubo, amutume. Mpawo bakatuma bantu bali makumi osanwe, nkabela bakali kuyandaula mazuba otatwe, pele tabakamujene pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
