        {
          "text": "Lino bantu bamunzi bakaambila Elisha kuti, Bona! Bukale bwamunzi buli kabotu, mbubonya mbuli simalelo wesu mbwaabwene, pele maanzi mabi, ayalo nyika tiikuzyi micelo. ",
