        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakainka kubutoolo bwamaanzi, wawaala munyo mukati, wati, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Ndasalazya aya maanzi. Takukooyooba limbi lufu nikuba kutakuzya micelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
